<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakhstan auctions 500 mln tenge bills June 3.</title>
<headline>Kazakhstan auctions 500 mln tenge bills June 3.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan will auction 500</p>
<p>million tenge of three-month MKM discount Treasury bills on June</p>
<p>3, the National Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the three-month issue:</p>
<p>    Series number		  KZ43K0409971</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   500 million tenge</p>
<p>    Denominations		  100 tenge</p>
<p>    Tenor			    91 days</p>
<p>    Issue date		     June 3</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  Sept 4, 1997</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
